Z||000017||286SE'S||04-23-2001||05:30 PM||||There is an 85 Gt that I pass each morning on the way to work that has both the wing and the luggage rack. He always has one of those fold up ladders lying across it. I think he<BR>may be a painter. <BR>The 'LOOK' of a luggage rack is an aquired taste. It was popular on little cars in the 60's and 70's and gave a sort of 'weekend escape' look to the cars. My Fiat 850 and X1/9 had luggage racks and my 2M4 has one so it looks fine to me. My 2M6 has that spoiler and I look at and am still not sure I like it or not. It is a strange chunk of plastic! ||||reg||1
